<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-14T06:20:04.354Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 06:20:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard has continued to block Chinese Coast Guard water-cannon attacks on its vessels during medical evacuations at Ayungin Shoal and in the Luzon Strait, while also confronting the Chinese research vessel Tan Suo Yi Hao that entered the area. Philippine forces repelled five Vietnam-flagged fishing boats near Kota Island and opened an upgraded PCG station on Pag-asa Island, reinforcing its presence on the disputed atoll. The navy conducted passing exercises with Japanese ships, and ASEAN coast guards are working on a common legal framework for maritime security. 176 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPRm5oS1NhU2o2b0NrWEpuZ0tPTHhpRC03bFNTS1BialJVYmhLMnkzZnB1a1RmLThKaTVzTHZQb01sTHdqX2RVOWZPZjBUSEc0X2pLMGQ5ZmVUX3c1SjNtMmdiSEUzVlNsSDFybUtuYW5WM0tNUWR4aEMxaldJaVhuWWFHN3FfTmlRNGtKYTNUMWV4N0lSR184SHU5TG9EZV9yeFFEM0NuYW9uRUhWUEhwdTZldmtlWE0yOHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Diplomacy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNa3NkaVVwSERuS2R4ME5wNnhCUUZDQmhIckIzWm44U3JIR0Q3bEJBUmZZZ0xTQ1d0RnBDQ2dfaGhCS1VfaFYwVm9MWkVYUThESGhJVHdzb3RQeEo3ODFZa1l1VmZhQWh2ZV9FdWhTdnI3V0FOa2djTjZZTnVXR2ZWbUJCNFp3T18zY2dOUFFZUUpVamNDNEkxZWJZcGE4UDhZUFNBYTVfNWh4Q0Z5cy1ITQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Awani International&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNcjBxemRVNzVBbTlvME5wT2xsRHQzQllOU05GRjlHVDBuUWFwWVJSMGtPZXUyMW96bnpsZy1Sc01MVF9LOHRpWklQR2s1MS0wLVdrMXc2MEZBSlZBbkJUckJBeUtCajZoYkV0YmtsT2FVWmtIYVdEckxDLVFNdERBdDJiS2ZxMjYyaW5keFVhcnc2WGtmNUcxSFQ0ZlluTENhenlDY2FhM3pfSU1SdkJKbUtPMk9EV2IzVlVoN3lB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rappler&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE9PcDB3akZVa3lLQ1U5X0ZWaGhUSzZnVVdBRkxVaUozeVgxYjREazN4dXRWYkhxNmRvWG1yc3E4M